<title>AUSTRALIA: Bunge lifts Defiance offer to A$1.95/shr.</title>
<headline>Bunge lifts Defiance offer to A$1.95/shr.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bunge Foods Queensland Pty Ltd said on Wednesday it has increased its offer for Defiance Mills Ltd to A$1.95 a share in cash and has urged shareholders to accept the revised offer.</p>
</text>
